   "source": [
    "12-month hospitalization risk\n",
    "### Senior AI/ML Engineer take-home, review notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "**Question:** Which patients are most likely to be hospitalized in the next 12 months, based on information available *before* that period?\n",
    "\n",
    "**Approach:** Audit data quality and target leakage, split by unique patient, compare two default tabular models on a development split, evaluate once on a held-out test split, and score all 5,000 new patients.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Run:** Place `patients.csv` and `patients_to_score.csv` beside this notebook. Run all cells top to bottom. The notebook creates `risk_scores.csv` and `writeup.md` in the same directory. No tuning, deployment, or UI.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Critical caveat:** `discharge_summary_count` is withheld because its association with the outcome and distribution mismatch strongly suggest leakage. Confirm when it was recorded before using it in production."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6fda188b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
