    "## 7. Evaluate once on the held-out test set\n",
    "\n",
    "ROC-AUC measures patient ranking over all thresholds. PR-AUC matters because hospitalization is uncommon. Brier score assesses probability error. For care teams with limited outreach capacity, top-decile precision, recall, and lift are actionable."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
